 This routine lets you select a list of files to be downloaded
 from one or more extra devices.  For example, CD-ROM drives.
 When you are done selecting, you may choose to have your chosen
 files archived in the background and placed in your mailbox.

 Note that a newer version of what you seek might be found in
 the 'normal' file libraries here. It pays to search first.

 Also note that it is more efficient for all concerned if you use
 the various contents files available here (or Aquarium, in the case
 of Fish Disks), to make your selections before you call. Thanks!
